        "overwritten-file-body.lua"
      ]
    },
    {
      "problem": "An MFA-message literal and any shell call were described as phishing delivery.",
      "fix": "Require a process-input write whose receiver derives from io.popen and whose message derives from the MFA portal format, alongside secret upload.",
