      ]
    },
    {
      "problem": "Normal editor-worker startup, or merely printing a Lua command beside an unused FFI helper, was hostile.",
      "fix": "Bind the named native helper and its command parameter to the module-level invocation. Report those mechanics as notable; require a concealed Defender-bypass companion for the archive attack finding.",
